# This repository is public, and its own .polyctl/ state is per-checkout development
# state: .polyctl/config.json carries absolute home paths, a session id and reviewer
# argv. .polyctl-project stays tracked; the state it points at stays on the machine.
# (Product repositories are different: their ledgers and reviews are evidence.)
.polyctl/
